; value_t's rounding operations other than roundto() and reduce/unreduce
; reject a value that is not an integer, amount, balance or sequence, each
; with its own message.

2024/01/01 Grocer
    Expenses:Food    $10.00
    Assets:Cash

test eval 'round("abc")' -> 1
__ERROR__
While evaluating value expression:
  round("abc")
  ^^^^^^^^^^^^
While rounding abc:
While calling function 'round abc':
Error: Cannot set rounding for a string
end test

test eval 'truncate("abc")' -> 1
__ERROR__
While evaluating value expression:
  truncate("abc")
  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
While truncating abc:
While calling function 'truncate abc':
Error: Cannot truncate a string
end test

test eval 'floor([2024/01/01])' -> 1
__ERROR__
While evaluating value expression:
  floor([2024/01/01])
  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
While flooring 2024/01/01:
While calling function 'floor 2024/01/01':
Error: Cannot floor a date
end test

