test eval 'rounded(($1.25, "x"))' -> 1
__ERROR__
While evaluating value expression:
  rounded($1.25, "x")
  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
While rounding x:
While calling function 'rounded ($1.25, x)':
Error: Cannot set rounding for a string
end test
